    "description": "Minimal, clean and retro watch face for Wear OS, with three configurable complication spaces.\r\n\r\nThe watch face presents you with 2 styles, 20+ handpicked color palettes to match your everyday styling.\r\n\r\n\u2022 Built with Watch Face Format.\r\n\u2022 Supports watches running on Wear OS 4 or higher.\r\n\u2022 Minimal, Clean & Battery Efficient.\r\n\u2022 3 configurable complication spaces.\r\n\u2022 20+ handpicked color palettes.\r\n\r\nFacing issues? don't hesitate to drop us a mail at support@sparkine.com",
